  era: "Section 17 \xB7 Regional Powers \xB7 18th century"
  title: Shivaji
  text: Shivaji, who lived from 1630 to 1680, carved out an independent kingdom from Bijapur and Mughal territory, built forts and a navy, and was crowned Chhatrapati at Raigad in 1674. He ruled with a council of eight ministers, the Ashta Pradhan.
